  "description": "**Volkswagen Golf Mk1 (1983) — Low Poly 3D Model**\n\nRealistic low-poly 3D model of the Volkswagen Golf Mk1 (1983), featuring high-quality PBR textures. Perfect for use in games, background scenes, visualizations, or archviz projects.\n\nThe model is optimized for real-time engines like Unity and Unreal Engine, combining a low polygon count with realistic textures that preserve the car’s authentic 1980s look — from its classic hatchback silhouette to chrome details and slightly aged paint.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* **Model year:** 1983 \n* **Format:** BLEND / FBX \n* **Style:** Low Poly with realistic PBR textures \n* **Textures:** BaseColor\n* **Intended use:** Games, visualizations, environment props, AR/VR projects \n* **Optimization:** Suitable for mobile and desktop platforms",
